) VALUES (
    'c2bcac43-6f4e-4a54-8e92-7c1f49515a37',
    '363bde4e-dd1e-40bc-b488-1801f4a86663',
    'Digital Tools for Community Health: What Works',
    'Zida za Pa Intaneti za Zaumoyo wa Mmudzi: Zomwe Zimagwira Ntchito',
    'Smartphone apps like YendaNafe help CHWs work more efficiently, but technical barriers '
    '(phone malfunctions, poor battery, network issues) must be addressed for sustained use.',
    'Pulogalamu za foni yam''manja ngati YendaNafe zimathandiza makhwao kuchita ntchito bwino, '
