    '["CHWs should report phone problems immediately — don''t wait for replacement cycles", '
    '"Charge phones fully each night — battery drain is a top reported barrier", '
    '"Use offline mode when network is unavailable — data syncs when connection returns", '
    '"Supervisors should ensure refresher training happens quarterly", '
    '"Program managers should negotiate better data bundle rates with telecom providers"]'::jsonb,
    '["Makhwao ayenera kuwuzira za mavuto a foni mwadzidzidzi — musayembekezere kusinthidwa", '
    '"Chitani batri masiku onse — kuchepa kwa batri ndi vuto lalikulu", '
    '"Gwiritsani ntchito offline ngati mulibe network — data idzafika pamene muli ndi connection", '
    '"Owunira ayenera kuthandiza kaphunzitso ka quarterly", '
    '"Oyang''anira ntchito ayenera kufunsa data bundles bwino ndi opanga malonda a network"]'::jsonb,
    '[{"takeaway_index": 2, "stat_ref": "Technical barriers limit adoption", "evidence_strength": "moderate"}]'::jsonb,
