    'After Delivery: Mother and Baby Need Care',
    'Kutsekereza Kwa: Amayi ndi Ana Amafunika Chithandizo',
    '96% of rural women have a health facility within 10km, but only 3% of mothers and 3% of newborns '
    'receive postnatal care within 24 hours. The first week is critical for survival.',
    '96% ya amayi ku mzano ali ndi chipatala maulendo 10, koma okha 3% amalandira chithandizo mofulumira. '
    'Sabata yoyamba ndi yofunika kwambiri.',
    '["Visit a health center within 24 hours of delivery — not just a clinic", '
