    '"Amayi ndi ana onse ayenera kuwunidwa", '
    '"Ngati mwabereka kunyumba, pitani ku chipatala mwadzidzidzi", '
    '"Bwererani kuwunidwa mu sabata yoyamba ngakhale mukukhutira", '
    '"Bweretsani mwana wake kuti awunidwe"]'::jsonb,
    '[{"takeaway_index": 0, "stat_ref": "Facility access high but PNC low", "evidence_strength": "strong"}]'::jsonb,
