    '98c2ceb9-32c6-4f7c-bf60-f395e7d595ff',
    'e87a8b6a-1762-479e-b82a-a6dc10697ee0',
    'Malawi Health by the Numbers: MDHS 2024',
    'Zaumoyo za Malawi ndi Ma Namba: MDHS 2024',
    'The 2024 Malawi Demographic and Health Survey provides the most comprehensive picture of '
    'the nation''s health — covering demographics, maternal health, child health, nutrition, HIV, malaria, '
    'and family planning across all 28 districts.',
    '2024 Malawi Demographic and Health Survey imapereka chithunzi chokwanila cha zaumoyo za dziko — '
    'ikufika kwa anthu, zaumoyo za amayi, ana, zakudya, HIV, malungo, ndi kupanga banja m''ma district onse 28.',
    '["Use MDHS data to compare your district''s indicators to national averages", '
    '"Identify which health areas need the most attention in your catchment", '
    '"Share key statistics with community leaders to support health planning", '
    '"Use the data to advocate for resources where gaps are largest", '
    '"Track progress against MDHS benchmarks over time"]'::jsonb,
    '["Gwiritsani ntchito data ya MDHS kuwonerana za district yanu ndi za dziko lonse", '
    '"Pezani zaumoyo zomwe zafunika kwambiri m''galamo yanu", '
    '"Gawilani ndi anzawa za zonena kuti muthandize kupanga plani ya zaumoyo", '
    '"Gwiritsani ntchito data kukankhira zida pamene mipata ndi yayikulu", '
    '"Yang''anirani mmene zikuyendera potsatira za MDHS"]'::jsonb,
    '[{"takeaway_index": 0, "stat_ref": "National survey coverage", "evidence_strength": "strong", "value": "28 districts"}]'::jsonb,
    'infographic', 'maternal_health', 'dho,mohp', 'info',
